n}=∅$ if $a≢b\\,(\\text{mod}\\,n)$\n\n- Residue classes modulo $n$ form a partition of the set of all integers: \n\n$$\nZ=[0]_{n}\\cup [1]_{n}\\cup ⋯\\cup [n-1]_{n}\n$$\n\n- The integers modulo $n$ is defined as the set containing all distinct residue classes modulo $n$: \n\n$$\n{Z}_{n}={[0]_{n},\\,[1]_{n},\\,…,\\,[n-1]_{n}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following properties:\n\n- $[0]_{12}\\cap [6]_{12}=∅.$\n\n- $Z=[0]_{12}\\cup [1]_{12}\\cup ⋯\\cup [11]_{12}.$\n\n- ${Z}_{12}={[0]_{12},[1]_{12},⋯,[11]_{12}}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-f018e54d-142b-5443-b618-b3c381ce86eb" "answer-field-a1d15121-09a7-5bb5-9596-3cceaf06e5cd" "answer-field-27247094-17db-5e37-bcae-0cf5549e29af"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-f018e54d-142b-5443-b618-b3c381ce86eb" :answer-field/id #uuid "f018e54d-142b-5443-b618-b3c381ce86eb" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-59a755d6-dd21-56a7-a444-c6a85453eee1" :answer-field/choices ["answer-608ab3d0-e141-5dba-86be-118421761875" "answer-2c082879-e35e-529b-bf83-498ccc230eb9" "answer-59a755d6-dd21-56a7-a444-c6a85453eee1"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-608ab3d0-e141-5dba-86be-118421761875" :answer/id #uuid "608ab3d0-e141-5dba-86be-118421761875" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "Z" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2c082879-e35e-529b-bf83-498ccc230eb9" :answer/id #uuid "2c082879-e35e-529b-bf83-498ccc230eb9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[3]_{12}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-59a755d6-dd21-56a7-a444-c6a85453eee1" :answer/id #uuid "59a755d6-dd21-56a7-a444-c6a85453eee1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "∅" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-a1d15121-09a7-5bb5-9596-3cceaf06e5cd" :answer-field/id #uuid "a1d15121-09a7-5bb5-9596-3cceaf06e5cd" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field