n\n- Two distinct residue classes have an empty intersection: $[a]_{n}\\cap [b]_{n}=∅$ if $a≢b\\,(\\text{mod}\\,n)$\n\n- Residue classes modulo $n$ form a partition of the set of all integers: \n\n$$\nZ=[0]_{n}\\cup [1]_{n}\\cup ⋯\\cup [n-1]_{n}\n$$\n\n- The integers modulo $n$ is defined as the set containing all distinct residue classes modulo $n$: \n\n$$\n{Z}_{n}={[0]_{n},\\,[1]_{n},\\,…,\\,[n-1]_{n}}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have the following properties:\n\n- There are $11$ distinct residue classes modulo $11.$\n\n- $[5]_{11}\\cap [10]_{11}=∅.$\n\n- ${Z}_{11}={[0]_{11},\\,[1]_{11},\\,…,\\,[10]_{11}}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-37ae3642-035a-599a-a72e-0d5e712e7054" "answer-field-f1f2f6b7-d889-5ab3-9003-1691704c6113" "answer-field-fd3fc3a4-ac23-58a2-9227-8ac4db6385c8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-37ae3642-035a-599a-a72e-0d5e712e7054" :answer-field/id #uuid "37ae3642-035a-599a-a72e-0d5e712e7054" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-7031c594-1614-52f5-bbca-a4d2867b00e8" :answer-field/choices ["answer-81e51a0c-ed4c-5398-bdc0-1626c1168148" "answer-7031c594-1614-52f5-bbca-a4d2867b00e8" "answer-524616ef-b4aa-5821-952e-2d370c8b92fc" "answer-4a59bc11-205d-5538-909d-cbd2ef20b03f" "answer-97e24b16-8860-55e1-b3db-ef84b5cc81d8" "answer-73af8c90-ce2b-5afd-ada7-58ab041cddc3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-81e51a0c-ed4c-5398-bdc0-1626c1168148" :answer/id #uuid "81e51a0c-ed4c-5398-bdc0-1626c1168148" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7031c594-1614-52f5-bbca-a4d2867b00e8" :answer/id #uuid "7031c594-1614-52f5-bbca-a4d2867b00e8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-524616ef-b4aa-5821-952e-2d370c8b92fc" :answer/id #uuid "524616ef-b4aa-5821-952e-2d370c8b92fc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :ans